  <div class="landing-hero__inner">
    <h1>AgeMap</h1>
    <p class="landing-hero__lead">AgeMap is a visual app for managing the ages and birthdays of family, friends, and colleagues. See everyone laid out by age on a single screen, with family tree, birthday reminders, and gift records in one place.</p>
    <p>
